Perhaps my wizard mode character is too good... I played with it some:
Teleported back to the bigroom level, wished for 8 cursed scrolls of
genocide, created about 50-60 orcs/Mordor-orcs/orc-captains/Uruk-Hai,
teleported myself to another side of the room and started smashing (with
a +50 Excalibur). I deliberately didn't use wands or spells; the worst
thing I had was 10 HP below my maximum (that came from wielding
Excalibur) - the orcs didn't even lower my HP.

Sometimes it's great fun avenging dead (non-wizard-mode) characters...
("You killed my last character! How about tasting this +50 Excalibur?
Or do you prefer a wand of death? How about a cockatrice corpse and
a wand of striking?")

